    <briefdescription>
<para>Base struct template providing common storage and accessors for runtime value-wrapper types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the stored value.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
The <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value__base__" kindref="compound">value_base_</ref></computeroutput> struct template provides the <computeroutput>T <ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value__base___1a8f1747b0fb288001d51754dfb8c53b0e" kindref="member">value_</ref>{}</computeroutput> member, an explicit <computeroutput>operator T()</computeroutput> conversion, and a <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value__base___1aedc41334c71b7711435aee0cb8f44fb3" kindref="member">get()</ref></computeroutput> accessor, shared by <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1genuine__integral__value" kindref="compound">genuine_integral_value</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value" kindref="compound">value</ref>&lt;T&gt;</computeroutput>, and the floating point specialisation <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1value" kindref="compound">value</ref>&lt;T&gt;</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>It inherits from <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1op" kindref="compound">op</ref></computeroutput> so that all derived types satisfy the <computeroutput><ref refid="conceptmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1is__op" kindref="compound">is_op</ref></computeroutput> concept without each struct needing to inherit from <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1type__traits_1_1op" kindref="compound">op</ref></computeroutput> directly. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
